spellcraft-discipline-rote = Rote
spellcraft-discipline-rote-desc = Prepared spells you know by heart. No building, no fuss.
spellcraft-discipline-glyphwork = Glyphwork
spellcraft-discipline-glyphwork-desc = Slot glyphs into a chain: a Form, then Effects, then Augments.
spellcraft-discipline-sigil = Sigil
