spellcraft-discipline-tarot = Tarot
spellcraft-discipline-tarot-desc = Draw cards that hold single-use spells, upright or reversed.
spellcraft-discipline-ritual = Ritual
spellcraft-discipline-ritual-desc = Circles, offerings and rites: new wands, new knowledge, and spells too big to cast alone.

